  requires $\forall i < P, \left(\forall y < \left(2\right)^{m}, \left(\left(\operatorname{dlogAfter}\left(\left(i + 1\right), y\right) < \left(\left(\operatorname{pAt}\left(i\right) - 1\right) \cdot \left(2\right)^{\left(D - \operatorname{cl}\right)}\right)\right)\right)\right)$
