  requires $\left(\left(\left(\operatorname{cb} + \operatorname{bits}\right) + 1\right) \le \operatorname{dim}\right)$
  assumes $\left(\left(\left(\left(\left(\ket{0}_{q_{\operatorname{band}\left(0, \left(3 \cdot \left(\operatorname{bits} + 1\right)\right), 3\right)}} \otimes \ket{0}_{q_{\operatorname{band}\left(2, \left(\left(3 \cdot \left(\operatorname{bits} + 1\right)\right) + 2\right), 3\right)}}\right) \otimes \ket{0}_{q_{\operatorname{band}\left(\operatorname{cb}, \left(\operatorname{cb} + \operatorname{bits}\right), 1\right)}}\right) \otimes \ket{0}_{q_{\left(\operatorname{cb} + \operatorname{bits}\right)}}\right) \otimes \ket{b}_{q_{\operatorname{band}\left(1, \left(\left(3 \cdot \left(\operatorname{bits} + 1\right)\right) + 1\right), 3\right)}}\right) \otimes \ket{0}_{q_{\left(\left(3 \cdot \left(\operatorname{bits} + 1\right)\right) + 2\right)}}\right)$
