  bind $\left(\operatorname{base} < \operatorname{dim}\right)$
  bind $\alpha$
  requires $\left(2 \le n\right)$
  requires $\left(\left(\left(\operatorname{base} + \left(3 \cdot n\right)\right) + 3\right) \le \operatorname{cb}\right)$
  requires $\left(\left(\operatorname{cb} + n\right) \le \operatorname{dim}\right)$
